WEBVTT

00:02:26.934 --> 00:02:31.147
We keep cutting down trees
to grow more food,

00:02:31.147 --> 00:02:35.526
and we keep wasting food
which ends up in landfills and rots,

00:02:35.568 --> 00:02:37.069
generates methane.

00:02:38.362 --> 00:02:40.573
The good news is
that we have the technology

00:02:40.615 --> 00:02:42.700
and the science today

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:44.660
to grow enough food to feed the world

00:02:44.702 --> 00:02:47.288
and to address our food waste problems.

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:49.415
We have the knowledge,

00:02:49.457 --> 00:02:50.917
but we're not using it.

00:02:51.751 --> 00:02:54.253
There are exciting examples
from my ecosystem

00:02:54.295 --> 00:02:57.298
where we're seeing dramatic impact.

00:02:57.673 --> 00:03:00.509
The Songhai Center in Benin Republic